      "message": "This checks just the first page, while pkvm_host_ept_map() below updates the whole range of pages?\n\nSo we should rather use __host_check_page_state_range(). But it seems this ad-hoc update_host_ept_prot() is not needed anyway, we can (and probably should) use more generic memory protection APIs which do the needed checks anyway (see my other comment).",
